Settings Reference", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [254.03948974609375, 433.4051208496094], "pos": [-423.5653381347656, -668.421875], "id": 55, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 9}, {"outputs": [{"name": "prompt", "links": [76], "label": "提示词文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"name": "show_help", "label": "show_help", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "show_help"}], "color": "#322", "widgets_values": ["最后禁止生成字幕。画面没有文字。禁止出现任何文字\nsubject_definitions:  \n<Subject 1> is the young East Asian woman in <Picture 1>, with long black hair styled in a high loose bun, soft face-framing wisps, fresh fair skin with a natural matte finish (no oily shine or reflective highlights), natural pink lips, and a warm gentle smile. She wears a thin-strapped white camisole. The image is a clean head-and-shoulders portrait against a plain white background.  \n<Subject 2> is the skin-tone / nude-beige seamless wireless bra shown in <Picture 2> — a one-piece bralette-style seamless underwire-free bra. Its exact color, pattern, and structure are defined by <Picture 2> and must be reproduced as-is.  \n<Picture 1> is the head-and-shoulders portrait reference for [Shot 1] and [Shot 7], showing <Subject 1> against a plain white background.  \n<Picture 2> is the flat-lay product reference for [Shot 3] and [Shot 6], showing <Subject 2> from a near-top-down angle on a plain white surface with the front structure fully visible.\n\nsummary:  \n[reference generation + keyframe completion] The target video is a 15-second vertical 9:16 social-commerce seeding short. <Subject 1> introduces <Subject 2> and demonstrates a clear before-and-after wearing effect. CRITICAL RULE A — SPEAKING: in every shot where <Subject 1>'s face is on screen she must be visibly talking, mouth open, lips moving in clear lip-sync (real diegetic speech, NOT voice-over). CRITICAL RULE B — NO TEXT: the video must contain ZERO subtitles, ZERO captions, ZERO on-screen text, ZERO watermark; the Chinese lines inside <d> tags are voice script ONLY and must never be shown as subtitles. <Picture 1> anchors on-camera portraits; <Picture 2> anchors static product close-ups.\n\nretention_analysis:  \n<Subject 1> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 2], [Shot 4], [Shot 5], [Shot 7]): fully_preserved - the high loose bun, face-framing wisps, fair matte skin, natural pink lips, thin-strapped white camisole, and head-and-shoulders framing are retained exactly as in <Picture 1>. In [Shot 1], [Shot 5], [Shot 7] she is clearly speaking with open-mouth lip movement.  \n<Subject 2> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 3], [Shot 4], [Shot 6]): fully_preserved - the skin-tone / nude-beige seamless wireless bra from <Picture 2> keeps its exact overall shape, color, and appearance, matching <Picture 2> exactly.  \n<Picture 1> ([Shot 1] first frame, [Shot 7] final frame): fully_preserved - used as opening and closing frame anchor.  \n<Picture 2> ([Shot 3], [Shot 6] keyframe): fully_preserved - used as static composition anchor for product close-ups.\n\ndetailed_description:  \nThe target video is a bright, punchy vertical 9:16 social-commerce seeding short with clean indoor lighting, a soft white background, and a natural matte skin look. <Subject 1> talks to the viewer like a bestie; when her face is visible she is TALKING with mouth open and lips moving in sync. There is absolutely NO subtitle, NO caption, NO on-screen text and NO subtitle track in the whole video. The <d> Chinese lines are voice script only — generate the speech audio and lip-sync, but never display them as text.\n\n[Shot 1] Opens from <Picture 1>: head-and-shoulders portrait of <Subject 1> on plain white background, exact hairstyle, makeup, thin-strapped white camisole, warm smile, matte skin. She lifts <Subject 2> (skin-tone seamless bra from <Picture 2>) by its straps into the lower frame. She looks at the lens and SPEAKS, mouth open, lips moving in sync, bright fast female bestie tone (S1): <d>[Chinese] 穿普通内衣，勒痕真的太尴尬了。</d> (voice script only — do NOT show as subtitle)\n\n[Shot 2] At 00:02.000, side view of <Subject 1>'s shoulder and upper torso in the thin-strapped white camisole, underneath a plain ordinary wired bra with hard underwire and seam lines. Through the white fabric, realistic red pressure marks show: a reddish strap line across her shoulder and a faint cup-line indentation on her side, like real tight-underwear marks. Matte skin, no shine. Camera pushes in slightly. <Subject 1> (S1) continues SPEAKING, voice heard off-frame: <d>[Chinese] 钢圈压胸，肩带还留红印。</d> (voice script only — do NOT show as subtitle)\n\n[Shot 3] At 00:04.500, static flat-lay close-up of <Subject 2> on plain white surface, using <Picture 2> as exact keyframe, same orientation, seamless skin-tone bra fully visible, no hand movement, no stretch, held still. <Subject 1> (S1) SPEAKS off-frame, same tone: <d>[Chinese] 看看这件，无痕无钢圈，穿起来零存在感。</d> (voice script only — do NOT show as subtitle)\n\n[Shot 4] At 00:07.000, same side-view angle as [Shot 2]. <Subject 1> now wears <Subject 2> under the same camisole. Through the fabric the surface is perfectly smooth, no red marks, no cup lines, no indentations. She runs her hand over her shoulder to show the invisible finish. Camera trucks right slightly. <Subject 1> (S1) continues SPEAKING off-frame: <d>[Chinese] 穿上直接隐形，贴身衣也不显印。</d> (voice script only — do NOT show as subtitle)\n\n[Shot 5] At 00:09.500, medium close-up of <Subject 1> from front, same camisole, hairstyle, matte skin. She stands naturally and SPEAKS to the lens, mouth open, lips moving in sync, confident smile: <d>[Chinese] 胸型自然饱满，皮肤清爽不反光。</d> (voice script only — do NOT show as subtitle) Static shot, soft even lighting.\n\n[Shot 6] At 00:12.000, second static flat-lay close-up of <Subject 2>, same keyframe and orientation as [Shot 3], bra as-is, no hand, held still. <Subject 1> (S1) SPEAKS off-frame: <d>[Chinese] 超薄弹力，夏天不闷汗。</d> (voice script only — do NOT show as subtitle)\n\n[Shot 7] At 00:14.000, back to head-and-shoulders portrait matching <Picture 1>. She lifts her chin, looks at the lens, SPEAKS with open-mouth lip movement, ends with a confident smug smile and a small wink: <d>[Chinese] 闭眼冲就完了。</d> (voice script only — do NOT show as subtitle) Static hold. Video ends at 00:15.000.\n\noverall_soundscape:  \nClean bright indoor room tone throughout. Light fabric rustles as the bra is lifted, a soft snap when the strap is tugged, a gentle press sound on the cup fabric. <Subject 1>'s spoken lines are clear real speech (audio only, never text on screen).\n\nnon_diegetic_music:  \nFast punchy lo-fi hip-hop loop, driving mid tempo, tight kick, snappy finger snaps, bouncy bassline under the speech, small accent on the final wink.\n\nnegative_constraints:\n\n- ABSOLUTELY NO subtitles, captions, on-screen text, watermark, or title anywhere; do NOT generate or burn in any subtitle track. The <d> Chinese lines are voice script ONLY and must never be displayed as text.\n- <Subject 1> must be visibly SPEAKING with open-mouth lip movement in [Shot 1], [Shot 5], [Shot 7]; her lines are real speech, not voice-over, not text.\n- Keep <Subject 1> fully dressed: always the thin-strapped white camisole; never on camera in only the bra.\n- Keep <Subject 1>'s skin matte, no oily shine or reflective highlights.\n- Do not change <Subject 1>'s hairstyle, makeup, clothing, or framing.\n- Do not change <Subject 2>'s color; keep exact skin-tone / nude-beige from <Picture 2>.\n- Keep <Subject 2> matching <Picture 2>'s overall look; no black mesh, lace, prints, or dark decorations; no underwire, front closure, seam, padding, clasp, or extra logos.\n- Do not stretch, twist, or rotate <Subject 2> in product close-ups; keep flat-lay orientation identical to <Picture 2>.\n\n最后禁止生成字幕。画面没有文字。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "提示词"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CR Prompt Text", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "siz